# ============================================================================
# CULT-ULHU map file: eldritch_battlefield
#
# Wave 17 art pass: a dark eldritch battlefield in four zones —
# shattered_court (ruined courtyard), cavern_mouth (cave rocks),
# ashen_grove (dead forest), ember_shrine (torch-lit shrine).
# 72 placements. All models CC0 (Kenney Graveyard/Nature, KayKit
# Dungeon Remastered/Halloween Bits). See assets/world/MANIFEST.md.
# ============================================================================

